// Custom SSL cipher suite on an Oracle Cloud Infrastructure (OCI) load balancer
//
// A user-defined named set of ciphers that listeners and backend sets select
// through sslCipherSuiteName. The ciphers list is what a weak-algorithm audit
// reads, since a suite naming CBC, RC4, 3DES, or MD5 ciphers weakens every
