}

// Certificate bundle on an Oracle Cloud Infrastructure (OCI) load balancer
//
// A certificate uploaded directly to the load balancer rather than managed by
// the OCI Certificates service. Listeners and backend sets select one by name
// through certificateName. The bundle carries the leaf certificate and the
// issuing chain in PEM form, and certificates parses them into the validity
