  // COMPARTMENT_CONFIG_SOURCE, OBJECT_STORAGE_CONFIG_SOURCE,
  // DEVOPS_CONFIG_SOURCE, BITBUCKET_CLOUD_CONFIG_SOURCE, or
  // BITBUCKET_SERVER_CONFIG_SOURCE, plus a `workingDirectory`. Git-backed
